Unpack cross.tar to your home directory.
e.g /home/dexter/bin/cross/...


Set the pathes in the makefile accordingly:

DIRAVR = /home/dexter/bin/cross/
DIRAVRBIN = /home/dexter/bin/cross/bin/
DIRAVRUTILS = /home/dexter/bin/cross/utils/bin
DIRINC = /home/dexter/bin/cross/avr/lib
DIRLIB = /home/dexter/bin/cross/avr/lib


